From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 18:00:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/20] commit 7: Add audit entry creation and JSON
 serialization

- Expand auditLogEntry with all 15 business fields per design spec
- Implement auditCreateEntry() to build entry from client context:
  time (nanoseconds), instance_id (runid), proxy/server_addr, role,
  client_addr/type, user, db, command_name/type, command_keys,
  command_param (with encryption), use_time, extend
- Implement auditEntryToJSON() for manual JSON serialization
  with proper escaping of \, ", and control characters
- Implement auditFreeEntry() to free all SDS fields
- Update consumer thread and queue cleanup to use auditFreeEntry
- Add DEBUG AUDIT-ENTRY command and Tcl tests
---
